WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.070
Two sisters share the same parents.

2
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.710
One has blood group A.

3
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.330
The other has blood group O.

4
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.290
One has a scar on her
knee from a bike crash.

5
00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:12.730
And one is taller than the other.

6
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.550
Some of these differences
came from their genes.

7
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.690
Some came from their lives.

8
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:18.910
Which is which?

9
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.570
And where does a
feature like height fit?

10
00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.990
In this mission, you'll sort
variation into genetic and

11
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:25.800
environmental.

12
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:29.250
You'll find out what decides
features like height.

13
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.270
And you'll discover where
brand-new alleles come from in the

14
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.590
first place.

15
00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.870
Your mission: decide which of
the sisters' differences come

16
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:39.540
from genes, and which from life.
